  "goodToKnow": "Die Ausbeutung is exploitation: die Ausbeutung von Arbeitskräften, die Ausbeutung der Natur. The verb ausbeuten means to exploit; in mining, it also means simply to extract resources. Die Beute is loot or prey. Since 2023, Germany's Lieferkettengesetz (supply chain act) requires large companies to check their suppliers for human rights abuses such as Ausbeutung and child labour. Karl Marx made Ausbeutung a key concept."
